          "weight": 1.0
        }
      },
      "ThemeOverride": {
        "override_font_size": true,
        "font_size": 13
      },
      "Label": {
        "text": "Rain falls over the yard: streaks facing the camera. Two fog volumes - a box of drifting mist on the left, a ball of haze on the right - fog what is seen through them. Signs are Label3Ds, the star a Sprite3D that turns only about its up, the glow over the lamp an added one. The arcade screen shows a World3D of its own through its camera: its box, sun and pink sky are nowhere else. A sound goes round the yard, heard from the camera, and its script draws where it is. Arrows turn the camera."
      }
    },
